# ThreadSanitizer suppressions for Threads.mtapps in a WITH_TSAN build.
#
# Policy: only races inside libX11 and libXt themselves may be suppressed
# here, each with the reason it is not a Motif bug.  A report with a
# Motif frame on top (libXm, libMrm) is a Motif bug: fix it, do not
# suppress it.  See doc/thread-safety.md.
#
# libX11 and libXt are not instrumented, so ThreadSanitizer sees neither
# their memory accesses nor (apart from the pthread calls it intercepts)
# their synchronization; reports confined to them would be noise.  None
# has been seen so far, so nothing is suppressed.
